    "Titles": {
        "eng": "The Divine Emperor of Destiny",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "Xuan Qi, with mediocre talent, was originally just an unranked supernatural being on the list of powerful beings, whose life's ambition was simply to survive to the end in this world, prioritizing safety above all else. However, during an outing, he happened to witness the fierce battle between the Alluring Empress and an ancient demon, becoming an innocent bystander caught in the crossfire. In this critical moment, Xuan Qi unexpectedly activated the \"Heavenly Show\" system, gaining the ability to continuously gain \"Admiration Points\" by displaying the demeanor of a peerless master.",
        "jpn": null
    },
